ماذج أولية لحلول قابلة للتطبيق.</p></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-6 text-pretty text-center text-base !leading-[2.3] text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg\">يركّز الهاكاثون على تطوير أفكار عملية قابلة للقياس والتنفيذ، بما يسهم في تحويل البيانات والذكاء الاصطناعي إلى أدوات لصناعة أثر مجتمعي ملموس.</p></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:mt-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-6 text-lg font-bold shadow-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles size-6 shrink-0 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>✨ عن بُعد <span dir=\"ltr\">100%</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-3xl border border-brand-mint/40 bg-secondary/30 p-6 text-lg font-bold shadow-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trophy size-6 shrink-0 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 14.66v1.626a2 2 0 0 1-.976 1.696A5 5 0 0 0 7 21.978\"></path><path d=\"M14 14.66v1.626a2 2 0 0 0 .976 1.696A5 5 0 0 1 17 21.978\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h1.5a1 1 0 0 0 0-5H18\"></path><path d=\"M4 22h16\"></path><path d=\"M6 9a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M6 9H4.5a1 1 0 0 1 0-5H6\"></path></svg><span>🏆 جوائز تصل إلى <span dir=\"ltr\">$13,500</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><dl class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-border pt-8 text-center md:mt-12\"><div><dt class=\"text-2xl font-black text-accent sm:text-4xl\"><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"tabular-nums\">$<!-- -->0</span></dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground sm:text-sm\">إجمالي الجوائز</dd></div><div><dt class=\"text-2xl font-black text-accent sm:text-4xl\"><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"tabular-nums\">0</span></dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground sm:text-sm\">مجالات رئيسية</dd></div><div><dt class=\"text-2xl font-black text-accent sm:text-4xl\"><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"tabular-nums\">0</span></dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground sm:text-sm\">مراحل عملية</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section id=\"goals\" class=\"brand-surface grain relative scroll-mt-20 overflow-hidden md:scroll-mt-24\"><div class=\"dot-grid absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative py-20 sm:py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 items-center text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide bg-white/10 text-brand-mint\">الأهداف</span><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-4xl text-white\">أهداف الهاكاثون</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-pretty text-base leading-8 text-brand-mint-soft/80 mx-auto\">خلال الهاكاثون، يعمل المشاركون على:</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-6 md:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-mint/15 text-brand-mint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-white\">فهم المشكلات المجتمعية</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-8 text-brand-mint-soft/80\">الانتقال من ملاحظة المشكلة إلى تحليلها وفهم أسبابها الحقيقية بالاعتماد على البيانات والمؤشرات القابلة للقياس.</p></div></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-mint/15 text-brand-mint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wrench size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-white\">تطوير حلول تقنية قابلة للتطبيق</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-8 text-brand-mint-soft/80\">تصميم نماذج أولية (Prototype) تستخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي لمعالجة تحديات مجتمعية واقعية.</p></div></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-mint/15 text-brand-mint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-white\">تحويل الأفكار إلى مبادرات</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-8 text-brand-mint-soft/80\">بناء حلول يمكن تطويرها لاحقًا إلى مبادرات مجتمعية مستقلة وقابلة للتنفيذ على أرض الواقع.</p></div></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-mint/15 text-brand-mint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-white\">تعزيز مهارات المشاركين</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-8 text-brand-mint-soft/80\">تزويد الفرق بخبرة عملية في تحليل المشكلات، واستخدام البيانات، والعمل الجماعي، وتصميم حلول قائمة على الأثر.</p></div></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-mint/15 text-brand-mint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-white\">الاستفادة من الإرشاد المتخصص</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-8 text-brand-mint-soft/80\">الحصول على دعم وإرشاد مباشر من خبراء ومختصين لمساعدة الفرق على تطوير أفكارها وتحسين نماذجها.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"tracks\" class=\"scroll-mt-20 md:scroll-mt-24\"><div class=\"container-page py-20 sm:py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 items-center text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide bg-secondary/50 text-accent\">المجالات</span><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-4xl text-foreground\">مجالات الهاكاثون</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-pretty text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground mx-auto\">يركّز الهاكاثون على تطوير حلول قائمة على البيانات والذكاء الاصطناعي لمعالجة تحديات مجتمعية حقيقية ضمن ثلاثة مجالات رئيسية:</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:gap-6 md:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"group h-full rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-soft-lg sm:p-9\"><div class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-secondary/60 text-accent transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-xl font-bold\">البيئة والسلوك البيئي</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-8 text-muted-foreground\">حلول تساعد على فهم السلوكيات البيئية وتعزيز الممارسات المستدامة، مثل إدارة النفايات، والاستهلاك المسؤول، والوعي البيئي، أو التحديات المرتبطة بالمناخ والموارد.</p></div></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"group h-full rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-soft-lg sm:p-9\"><div class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-secondary/60 text-accent transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-pulse size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.22 13H9.5l.5-1 2 4.5 2-7 1.5 3.5h5.27\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-xl font-bold\">الصحة العامة والنفسية</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-8 text-muted-foreground\">أفكار وتقنيات تساهم في دعم جودة الحياة والصحة النفسية والجسدية، وتحسين الوصول إلى المعلومات أو الخدمات ذات الصلة.</p></div></div><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"group h-full rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-soft-lg sm:p-9\"><div class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-secondary/60 text-accent transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-briefcase size-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-xl font-bold\">التوجيه المهني للشباب</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-8 text-muted-foreground\">حلول تساعد الشباب على فهم مساراتهم المهنية، وتطوير مهاراتهم، واتخاذ قرارات أكثر وعيًا بشأن التعليم والعمل وفرص المستقبل.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"why\" class=\"scroll-mt-20 bg-muted/40 md:scroll-mt-24\"><div class=\"container-page py-20 sm:py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 items-center text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide bg-secondary/50 text-accent\">لماذا الانضمام؟</span><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-4xl text-foreground\">لماذا عليك الانضمام؟</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-pretty text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground mx-auto\">لأن هاكاثون واحة AI ليس مجرد منافسة تقنية، بل مساحة عملية لتحويل التحديات المجتمعية إلى حلول قابلة للتطبيق باستخدام البيانات والذكاء الاصطناعي.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-6 md:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"transition-[opacity,transform] duration-700 ease-out will-change-[opacity,transform] motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-5 opacity-0\"><div class=\"flex h-full items-start gap-4 rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-accent/40 sm:gap-5 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-secondary/60 text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\